WEBVTT

00:00.600 --> 00:04.400
You upload a document – a PDF, Word or Excel file or an image –

00:04.400 --> 00:08.760
and choose from the list which data you want to redact.

00:09.180 --> 00:11.140
You click “Nuasmeninti” (Redact),

00:11.470 --> 00:16.840
and within a few seconds the app automatically detects and highlights the personal data.

00:17.200 --> 00:21.890
Before downloading, you quickly and easily review all the data found.

00:22.250 --> 00:24.830
Need to redact more data?

00:25.150 --> 00:28.360
Simply select the text or area of the page with the mouse.

00:28.670 --> 00:33.940
In the downloaded document the data is not just covered, but completely removed.

00:34.210 --> 00:38.670
The whole process runs on your computer or local server – for maximum data security.

00:39.040 --> 00:43.700
You don't even need an internet connection.
